        "policy": "Prior accounting experience is not mandatory, but foundational bookkeeping competence is non-negotiable. After completing Module 1, learners must demonstrate proficiency in: (1) Applying debit/credit rules, (2) Classifying assets, liabilities, income, and expenses, (3) Recording common journal entries, (4) Explaining the accounting equation, (5) Understanding trial balance mechanics, (6) Identifying source documents, and (7) Detecting basic recording errors. Students who do not pass receive remediation drills before beginning GST configuration."
