        "heading": "Accurate Books. Reconciled Records. GST-Ready Documentation.",
        "principle": "Balanced Books Are Necessary but Not Proof That Every Entry Is Correct. An automated trial balance or bank match does not guarantee accounting correctness. Every voucher must be backed by valid source documentation, correct account classification, proper tax rates, and independent verification.",
        "error_correction_rule": "Never delete or alter records merely to force reports to balance. Discrepancies must be investigated to their source, corrected with authorized adjustment vouchers, and supported by a clear audit trail."
